  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Juno: Transforming Evidence for Agriculture, Food and Climate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By harnessing the power of Artificial Intelligence and established scientific research methods, Juno will expedite the synthesis of diverse data sources, delivering scientific and technical conclusions for governments, funders, and policymakers worldwide.  We bring together researchers, policymakers, publishers, computer and data scientists, and evidence advocates from across fields and disciplines to break down traditional boundaries between research production and use.</narrative>
  </description>
